    <INTENT>The second kind of pack: host templates, address and date forms, surnames, transliteration and advisory word lists scoped to authored text in that language, never internal metadata or literal document readings.</INTENT>
    <PRD_REF>docs/PRD.md#PLAN</PRD_REF>
  </FEATURE_LANGUAGE_PACK>

